## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)
1. Deleting U+200B, or turning 003 Q16–Q20 into headings (zh-hans-a #8, zh-hans-b #12). The fragments are real, but they are the Korean source's block structure. The checker fails if the ZWSP count or the heading-level list changes. Same skip as round 4.
2. Rewriting exact amounts as 万/亿 (zh-hans-b #6), for example 1,579,589 → 157万9589. zh-hans NUMBER_THOUSAND_STYLE is comma. SINO_UNIT_MULTIPLIERS matches 萬/만, not simplified 万, so 157万9589 is parsed as 157 and 9589. The source integer 1579589 would then be missing (FAIL). Comma form kept. Round amounts that were already 万 (157万元 in the team bio) were not in this row.
3. Renumbering 018 "## 7." to "## 6." and "## 8." to "## 7." (zh-hans-b #22). The English file skips from 5 to 7 on purpose or by the same omission; the reviewer says so. The Korean source has the same numbers. Renumbering only the Simplified Chinese headings would diverge from that outline and change the digits the checker counts.
